WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:02.781
- [Narrator] There are
countless Chinatowns

00:00:02.781 --> 00:00:04.760
all over the world, and New York boasts

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.861
one of the most famous, full
of cheap produce, fish markets,

00:00:07.861 --> 00:00:10.901
and of course, a plethora of Chinese food.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.491
But, if you hop on the 1 train,

00:00:12.491 --> 00:00:13.869
take it to the Upper
West Side, you'll find

00:00:13.869 --> 00:00:15.640
a Chinese restaurant like no other,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.221
where half the menu is something else.

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:20.731
- Chuleta, chicharrones,
- Ropa vieja,

00:00:20.731 --> 00:00:23.478
- Tostones,
- Arroz y frijol.

00:00:23.478 --> 00:00:25.649
- [Narrator] This is La Caridad 78,

00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:27.968
New York's last Cuban Chinese restaurant.

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:30.218
- Comida china y cree-loya.

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:32.662
- Criolla.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.129
- [Narrator] How did this
unlikely culinary duo

00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:40.637
come to be? That's a great question.

00:00:40.637 --> 00:00:42.306
Enter Sam Lee.

00:00:42.306 --> 00:00:44.139
- Sorry, it's my wife.

00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:55.477
- [Narrator] Hundreds
of thousands of Chinese

00:00:55.477 --> 00:00:58.549
came to Cuba in the 19th
and early 20th century,

00:00:58.549 --> 00:01:01.007
establishing a strong
presence on the island.

00:01:01.007 --> 00:01:02.429
But when Castro came to power,

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:04.898
most Chinese immigrants,
like Sam's father, left,

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.629
many of them coming to the US.

00:01:07.629 --> 00:01:10.796
And thus, Cuban Chinese food was born.

00:01:32.607 --> 00:01:36.774
- [Narrator] So are there
any Cuban-born workers left?

00:01:39.107 --> 00:01:42.024
(speaking Spanish)

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.920
- [Narrator] While
Cuban-Chinese culture is fading,

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:03.278
La Caridad is a snapshot
of a strange moment in time

00:02:03.278 --> 00:02:07.445
where two vastly different
cultures merged together.

